I arrive at home.
I carry my shopping bag.
I walk up the stairs.
On the second floor, I meet Sabine.
She is standing in front of her door.
Her small dog Bruno is there too.
Bruno sees me and is happy.
"Hello, Maya!", Sabine says.
"Hello, Sabine", I answer.
"How are you today?", she asks.
"Thanks, I am doing well", I say.
"My work is done for today."
"Are you going for a walk with Bruno now?"
"Yes, we are going to the park", Sabine says.
I pet Bruno.
His fur is very soft.
"Have fun in the park!", I say.
"Thanks!", Sabine answers.
"Have a nice evening, Maya."
"Thanks, you too!", I call out.
I continue to my flat.
